; One summary for each sentence, for the pitch. Four cards a segment in (kind, send, s, n); at the segment that ends
; a sentence (send 1, 2 or 3) four cards out: L (the frames from the sentence's start to the end of its last sound;
; all of its frames if it has none), the frame where the fall to the end starts (the last vowel with stress 1, else
; the sentence's first segment if it is a vowel, else -1 for none), M (the frames from there to the end of the last
; sound) and the end: 2 for a question, else 1. Frames are counted from the sentence's start (f): f is 0 only at a
; sentence's first segment, since every segment has frames.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-18: a segment; at a sentence's first, whether it is a vowel
  04                    INP   send
  05                    INP   s
  06                    INP   n
  07                    CLA   f
  08                    SUB   00
  09                    TAC   fst
  10                    JMP   chk
  11            fst     CLA   m1
  12                    STO   fv
  13                    CLA   kind
  14                    SUB   n2
  15                    TAC   fz
  16                    JMP   chk
  17            fz      CLA   z
  18                    STO   fv
  19            chk     CLA   kind     19-43: the last stressed vowel, the end of the last sound, f on
  20                    SUB   n2
  21                    TAC   vow
  22                    JMP   snd
  23            vow     CLA   s
  24                    SUB   00
  25                    TAC   snd
  26                    SUB   00
  27                    TAC   tl
  28                    JMP   snd
  29            tl      CLA   f
  30                    STO   tail
  31            snd     CLA   kind
  32                    SUB   c8
  33                    TAC   sound
  34                    JMP   adv
  35            sound   CLA   f
  36                    ADD   n
  37                    STO   ls
  38            adv     CLA   f
  39                    ADD   n
  40                    STO   f
  41                    CLA   send
  42                    SUB   00
  43                    TAC   rec
  44                    CLA   ls       44-78: the sentence's summary, then start the next
  45                    TAC   lsf
  46                    JMP   ll
  47            lsf     CLA   f
  48                    STO   ls
  49            ll      OUT   ls
  50                    CLA   tail
  51                    TAC   tfv
  52                    JMP   th
  53            tfv     CLA   fv
  54                    STO   tail
  55            th      CLA   tail
  56                    TAC   none
  57                    OUT   tail
  58                    CLA   ls
  59                    SUB   tail
  60                    STO   t
  61                    OUT   t
  62                    JMP   endo
  63            none    OUT   m1
  64                    OUT   00
  65            endo    CLA   send
  66                    SUB   n2
  67                    TAC   e1
  68                    SUB   00
  69                    TAC   e2
  70            e1      OUT   00
  71                    JMP   rst
  72            e2      OUT   n2
  73            rst     CLA   z
  74                    STO   f
  75                    CLA   m1
  76                    STO   ls
  77                    STO   tail
  78                    JMP   rec
  80            kind    DATA  0
  81            send    DATA  0
  82            s       DATA  0
  83            n       DATA  0
  84            f       DATA  0
  85            fv      DATA  0
  86            tail    DATA  -1
  87            ls      DATA  -1
  88            t       DATA  0
  89            z       DATA  0
  90            m1      DATA  -1
  91            n2      DATA  2
  92            c8      DATA  8
